    "items": [
      {
        "type": "heading1",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "Longing for God’s House"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "label",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "For the choir director: on the Gittith. A psalm of the sons of Korah."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          1
        ],
        "lines": [
          "How lovely is your dwelling place,",
          "Lord of Armies."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          2
        ],
        "lines": [
          "I long and yearn",
          "for the courts of the Lord;",
          "my heart and flesh cry out for the living God."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          3
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Even a sparrow finds a home,",
          "and a swallow, a nest for herself",
          "where she places her young —",
          "near your altars, Lord of Armies,",
          "my King and my God."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          4
        ],
        "lines": [
          "How happy are those who reside in your house,",
          "who praise you continually."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "label",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "Selah"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          5
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Happy are the people whose strength is in you,",
          "whose hearts are set on pilgrimage."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          6
        ],
        "lines": [
          "As they pass through the Valley of Baca,",
          "they make it a source of spring water;",
          "even the autumn rain will cover it with blessings. ,"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          7
        ],
        "lines": [
          "They go from strength to strength;",
          "each appears before God in Zion."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          8
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Lord God of Armies, hear my prayer;",
          "listen, God of Jacob."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "label",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "Selah"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          9
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Consider our shield, God;",
          "look on the face of your anointed one."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          10
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Better a day in your courts",
          "than a thousand anywhere else.",
          "I would rather stand at the threshold of the house of my God",
          "than live in the tents of wicked people."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          11
        ],
        "lines": [
          "For the Lord God is a sun and shield.",
          "The Lord grants favor and honor;",
          "he does not withhold the good",
          "from those who live with integrity."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          12
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Happy is the person who trusts in you,",
          "Lord of Armies!"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      }
    ]
  },
